\par Clic incorporates an access system to external programmes that enables it to generate the content of activities in a dynamic manner. These external programmes must be DLL files, and must meet the specifications indicated on the }{
\uldb\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 next page}{\v\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 HELP_TECHAUTO}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 .
\par 
\par The activities included in the mental calculation examples use this system to generate different exercises each time they are run, by means of the }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 ARITH2}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  module.
\par 
\par When Clic loads an activity that uses the automatic generation system, it accesses the associated DLL in order to create the files (text or graphics) that will determine the content of the exercise. This access will be repeated every time the }{
\uldb\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 restart button}{\v\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 HELP_INIT}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  (green flag) is activated.
\par 
\par The DLL that are written for use by CLIC should allow the configuration of their working parameters. To adjust these parameters you have to activate the }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Configuration}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 
 button, which is to be found in the }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Activity options}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  window.
\par 
\par To create an activity automation DLL you have to use a C or C++ language compiler.
\par 
\par }{\uldb\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Click here to see an activity using automation}{\v\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 !EP("clic.exe CLIC:\\\\act\\\\arith\\\\combi1.ass", 0)}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 .
\par Note that their contents change every time the green flag is pressed. You can see how they were made by activating the menu }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Options | Activity Options }{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 and pressing the }{
\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Configuration button}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 .
