\cs16\lang1024\langfe1024\super\noproof #}{\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof  DLL_BASIC}}}{\b\fs24\cf2\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Basic characteristics
\par }{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 
\par The function of an automatic generation DLL is to fill the files that will determine the content 
of the activities, generally by a random process. The user can adjust the variables that control these random processes at the moment of creating or editing the activity.
