\par 
\par When CLIC loads an activity that uses the activity automation system, it follows this process:
\par 
\par }\pard \ql \fi-284\li284\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx284\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin284\itap0 {\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 \{bmc brodo.bmp\}\tab It loads the DLL by accessing the API function of Windows }{
\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 LoadLibrary}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 .
\par \{bmc brodo.bmp\}\tab It checks that the DLL is exporting the }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 GetClicDllVer}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  function, and if it exists it is accessed.
\par \{bmc brodo.bmp\}\tab If the DLL hasn't been found, or }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 GetClicDllVer}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 
 cannot be accessed, or the call to this function returns a posterior version of CLIC to that in use, an error message appears and the activity will be terminated.
\par \{bmc brodo.bmp\}\tab CLIC creates the files with the necessary content for carrying out the activities in the users' temporary directory. Initially these files are empty.
\par \{bmc brodo.bmp\}\tab }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 RemakeAct}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  is called so that the DLL will occupy itself with filling the content files according to the characteristics of the activity, reflected in a va
riable of the }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 ACTDATA}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  type, and from the automatic generation parameters that the user has adjusted, reflected in the }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Ops}{
\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  variable.
\par \{bmc brodo.bmp\}\tab The contents are loaded and the activity is started.
\par \{bmc brodo.bmp\}\tab If the user activates the "restart activity" button (green flag)}{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  RemakeAct}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  will be accessed again.
\par \{bmc brodo.bmp\}\tab When the activity is finished, Clic will destroy the temporary files used.
\par \{bmc brodo.bmp\}\tab If the user edits the activity and activates the }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Configuration}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  button in the options window of the activity,}{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 
 ConfigureDllOptions}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  will be called in order to modify the contents of the }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Ops}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  variable.
